    "long_instructions": "### **Generate with AI**\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. **Plan:** In `prompt.md`, write a prompt that makes the app show one of these messages when the user clicks **Check My Order**:\r\n   - `\"Free shipping!\"` or `\"User pays shipping.\"`\r\n\r\n2. **Build:** Upload `flowchart.png` and your prompt to make AI generate the code.\r\n\r\n3. **Test:** Try setting different prices for the shirt and check that the right message appears.\r\n\r\n4. **Check Code:** Look for where the code:\r\n   * declares a variable\r\n   * adds an event listener\r\n   * checks the `if` / `else` condition\r\n\r\n\r\n:::details [**Why is the price not updating on screen?**]\r\nEven though you are updating the price in `script.js`, you have not told your app to display these new values. Use AI to support you in adding code to `script.js` that will display the price as you change it.\r\n:::"
